OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,6,Fwith some hazy sunny spells. However
OL,7,Fthe cloud may be thick enough over
OL,8,FMoray and the north for the odd spot
OL,9,Fof rain in the morning. Warm in Moray,
OL,10,Feast coast less so.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry bright evening then a
OL,13,Fdry night with some clear spells,
OL,14,Fthough some patchy low cloud in the
OL,15,Feast.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FA mainly dry bright day
OL,18,Fwith some sunny spells. One or two
OL,19,Fbrief showers are possible in the
OL,20,Fwest. A very warm day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
